  "title": "Tropical Banana Bread",
  "description": "Banana bread gets a tropical update with the addition of crushed pineapple and flaked coconut in this moist, easy-to-make breakfast bread.",
  "authors": [
    "Frannie"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-19T00:26:52-04:00",
